---
const birthDate = new Date('1998-06-16');
const ageDiff = Math.abs(Date.now() - birthDate.getTime());
const age = Math.floor((ageDiff / (1000 * 3600 * 24)) / 365.25);
---

<section id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Sobre mí</h2>
    <div class="section-divider"></div>

    <div class="grid-2 align-start">
      <div class="profile-column">
        <div class="profile-image-container">
          <img 
            src="/assets/images/perfil.jpg" 
            alt="Daniel Patrón Gómez - Foto de perfil" 
            class="profile-img"
          />
          <div class="profile-badge-float">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-code"></i> Front-End Dev
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-stats">
          <div class="stat-card">
            <span class="stat-number">+4</span>
            <span class="stat-label">Años en BBVA Tech</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-card">
            <span class="stat-number">6+</span>
            <span class="stat-label">Apps Creadas</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-card">
            <span class="stat-number">DAM</span>
            <span class="stat-label">Grado Superior</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-content">
        <h3 class="about-subtitle">Desarrollador Front-End & Multiplataforma</h3>
        
        <p class="about-text">
          Soy Daniel, desarrollador apasionado por crear experiencias digitales ágiles, robustas y de alto impacto. Me especializo en la construcción de interfaces de usuario modernas y aplicaciones móviles de alta calidad.
        </p>
        <p class="about-text">
          Actualmente me desempeño como <strong>Front-end Developer en BBVA Technology en Europa</strong>, formando parte del desarrollo de la aplicación móvil de banca internacional (España, Italia y Alemania) utilizando tecnologías avanzadas como <strong>Lit, Web Components y Ember.js</strong>.
        </p>

        <div class="info-grid">
          <div class="info-pill">
            <span class="icon-circle"><i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot"></i></span>
            <div>
              <span class="info-label">Ubicación</span>
              <strong class="info-val">Guadalajara, España</strong>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="info-pill">
            <span class="icon-circle"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i></span>
            <div>
              <span class="info-label">Email</span>
              <strong class="info-val"><a href="mailto:dpatrongomez@gmail.com" class="email-link">dpatrongomez@gmail.com</a></strong>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="info-pill">
            <span class="icon-circle"><i class="fa-solid fa-cake-candles"></i></span>
            <div>
              <span class="info-label">Edad</span>
              <strong class="info-val">{age} años</strong>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="info-pill">
            <span class="icon-circle"><i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i></span>
            <div>
              <span class="info-label">Titulación</span>
              <strong class="info-val">Técnico Superior DAM</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .align-start {
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .profile-column {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .profile-image-container {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    transition: var(--transition);
  }

  .profile-image-container:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);
  }

  .profile-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }

  .profile-badge-float {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 16px;
    right: 16px;
    background: rgba(11, 29, 54, 0.85);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .profile-badge-float i {
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .about-stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .stat-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 14px 10px;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    transition: var(--transition);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }


  .stat-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: var(--primary);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .stat-number {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--primary);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .about-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    color: var(--navy-accent);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .about-text {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .about-text strong {
    color: var(--navy-accent);
  }

  .info-grid {
    margin-top: 28px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .info-pill {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    background: #ffffff;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    transition: var(--transition);
  }

  .info-pill:hover {
    border-color: rgba(221, 157, 20, 0.4);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .info-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .info-val {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--navy-accent);
  }

  .icon-circle {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    background: var(--primary-light);
    color: var(--primary);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: var(--transition);
  }

  .info-pill:hover .icon-circle {
    background: var(--primary);
    color: #ffffff;
    transform: scale(1.08);
  }

  .email-link {
    color: var(--navy-accent);
  }

  .email-link:hover {
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .info-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>

